{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03430","headline":"登总持寺阁 · 崔湜","name":"登总持寺阁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宿雨清龙界，晨晖满凤城。\n升攀重阁迥，凭览四郊明。\n井邑周秦地，山河今古情。\n纡余一水合，寥落五陵平。\n处处风烟起，欣欣草木荣。\n故人不可见，冠盖满东京。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔湜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03430.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03430","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}